window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Dive into a sizzling trilogy of nudist rom-coms! At a rural Oregon resort, a hot spring isn't the only kind of heat.</i></b><br> <br> Resort owner Eve Holt always maintains her professionalism—until former international football star Val Silva arrives. Oh yeah, he's sexy, flirty, down-and-dirty trouble. And Eve's resolve is beginning to crumble…<br> <br> Mara Severins thought \"naturist\" meant bird watching. She's shocked to find Au Naturel is a nudist resort. But when she meets assistant manager Ollie Jackson, neither can deny their steamy attraction…<br> <br> Heidi Mackenzie is the life of the party at Au Naturel. But her love life…not so great. Then Damian Petrescu arrives. The hot-as-hell, self-professed gypsy fortune teller wants <i>her</i>. Oh boy, this vacation is going to get wild.<br> <br> <b>The Complete Au Naturel Trilogy combines all three sizzling rom-coms in one collection—</b><b><i>Natural Passion</i></b><b>, </b><b><i>Natural Impulse</i></b><b>, and </b><b><i>Natural Satisfaction</i></b><b>.</b></p>"; 
